BaseVault_donate
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAmount
├── when the chain is not the active strategy
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoActiveAdapter
├── when the strategy deposit fails
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__DepositFailed
├── when the donation succeeds
│   ├── it should pull USDC from the donor
│   ├── it should deposit USDC into the active strategy
│   ├── it should not leave donated USDC idle in the vault
│   ├── it should emit Donation
│   ├── it should not mint shares
│   └── for ParentVault, it should not change totalShares
└── when the vault is paused
    └── it should still allow donations
